==Description==

The [[Image:Silk_Point_onCurve.svg|32px]] '''Silk Point_onCurve''' command creates a point, a Point_onCurve object, on a [[Silk_CubicCurve_4|CubicCurve_4]] or [[Silk_CubicCurve_6|CubicCurve_6]] (also works on some curves outside of Silk).

</translate>
