==Usage==

# Indicate a point by clicking on the curve in the [[3D_View|3D View]]
# There are several ways to invoke the tool.
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Silk_Point_onCurve.svg|16px]] Point onCurve}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|[[Image:Silk_Point_onCurve.svg|16px]] Silk → Point onCurve}} option from the menu.
# A point on the curve, a '''Point_onCurve''' object, is created.

